  "details": "Animations will always work for you, but often they won't be seen by other players, even if they reload your avatar. For some reason switching to an entirely different avatar and switching back will usually fix it, until you reset the avatar or switch out. It's really a coin flip if your animations are global or not, and it's incredibly frustrating as someone who derives joy from animations. Could potentially be part of the vague \"changing avatars while doing animations can cause issues\" announcement.",
